{"seq":2,"slug":"allocation-engine-reservation-locking","title":"拣货分配引擎与批次预留/锁定/释放机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/lot-batch-expiry-fefo-traceability-management/fefo-picking-expiry-allocation/allocation-engine-reservation-locking","wordCount":3083,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"拣货分配引擎与批次预留-锁定-释放机制\">拣货分配引擎与批次预留/锁定/释放机制</h1><p>一个电商大促零点的瞬间，同一批只剩 45 天保质期的进口常温奶，可能同时被三个渠道的订单行盯上：自营商城的即时单、跨境保税仓的 7 天履约单、第三方平台托管仓的备货单。系统若只把它标记成「有 300 件库存」，三张订单会各自认为拿得到货，超卖、拣空、临时改发近效期批次随之而来。真正解决问题的不是「有没有货」这个布尔量，而是<strong>谁在什么时间、以什么粒度、持有多久的处置权</strong>——这就是分配引擎与批次预留/锁定/释放机制要建的东西。本文承接 <a href=\"fefo-ordering-expiry-priority-principle\">FEFO 分配原理与效期优先排序</a> 的排序规则，把它落到一个可并发、可回滚、可审计的执行引擎上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>分配引擎在数据上做的事，是把一张<strong>订单需求</strong>转换成对<strong>批次库存单元</strong>的一组有时限的占用记录。它有三个恒不可省的输入：候选池（哪些批次此刻可参与）、占用语义（软锁还是硬锁、锁谁）、生命周期（占用何时建立、何时失效、何时归还）。这三者缺一，系统就退化成「有货即可下单」的粗糙模型。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[订单行请求: SKU + 数量 + 渠道 + 交付时限] --&gt; B[构建候选池&lt;br/&gt;Lot × Location × Status]&#10;  B --&gt; C[资格过滤&lt;br/&gt;QA 放行 / 温区 / 未召回 / RSL ≥ MRSL]&#10;  C --&gt; D[按 FEFO 评分排序&lt;br/&gt;exp, recv, lot_id]&#10;  D --&gt; E[尝试原子占用 CAS&lt;br/&gt;available_qty 递减]&#10;  E -- 冲突重试 --&gt; D&#10;  E -- 成功 --&gt; F[写 reservation 记录&lt;br/&gt;ttl + 幂等键]&#10;  F --&gt; G{支付成功且拣货完成?}&#10;  G -- 是 --&gt; H[占用转消耗 consumed&lt;br/&gt;账实核减]&#10;  G -- 否且超时/取消 --&gt; I[释放释放 release&lt;br/&gt;available_qty 回补]&#10;  H --&gt; J[拣货任务下发&lt;br/&gt;绑定 lot + location]&#10;  I --&gt; D\">flowchart TD\n  A[订单行请求: SKU + 数量 + 渠道 + 交付时限] --&gt; B[构建候选池&lt;br/&gt;Lot × Location × Status]\n  B --&gt; C[资格过滤&lt;br/&gt;QA 放行 / 温区 / 未召回 / RSL ≥ MRSL]\n  C --&gt; D[按 FEFO 评分排序&lt;br/&gt;exp, recv, lot_id]\n  D --&gt; E[尝试原子占用 CAS&lt;br/&gt;available_qty 递减]\n  E -- 冲突重试 --&gt; D\n  E -- 成功 --&gt; F[写 reservation 记录&lt;br/&gt;ttl + 幂等键]\n  F --&gt; G{支付成功且拣货完成?}\n  G -- 是 --&gt; H[占用转消耗 consumed&lt;br/&gt;账实核减]\n  G -- 否且超时/取消 --&gt; I[释放释放 release&lt;br/&gt;available_qty 回补]\n  H --&gt; J[拣货任务下发&lt;br/&gt;绑定 lot + location]\n  I --&gt; D</pre><p>占用（reservation）与拣货（pick）是两件不同的事，这一点最容易被写错。<strong>占用回答「这批货先归谁」</strong>，是订单履约前的产能承诺；<strong>拣货回答「从哪个库位取多少」</strong>，是仓库执行层的动作。二者之间隔着支付、合单、波次规划、补货等多个步骤，时间差可达数小时到数天。把占用直接等同于扣减库存，会在订单取消时留下无法回补的黑洞。三种占用模式的区别，本质是<strong>风险承担方不同</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>建立时机</th>\n<th>锁定的量</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>不预留（凭 ATP 下单）</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>吞吐最高、无锁竞争</td>\n<td>超卖风险高，跨境/多仓尤甚</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>软预留（soft reservation）</td>\n<td>订单创建即占</td>\n<td>逻辑可用量</td>\n<td>防超卖、实现轻</td>\n<td>未支付订单长期霸占库存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>硬预留（hard reservation）</td>\n<td>分仓/拣货下派时占</td>\n<td>物理库位的批次量</td>\n<td>精确定位、可支撑波次</td>\n<td>锁定粒度细、并发冲突多</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>工程上的常见折中是<strong>两级预留</strong>：下单时对 SKU 层做软预留（防超卖），下派仓库时把软预留沉降为对（批次，库位）的硬预留（防拣空）。两级之间用同一条 <code>reservation_id</code> 串起来，任何一级失败都能沿链路完整回滚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"候选池构建与批次评分\">候选池构建与批次评分</h2><p>候选池不是「所有库存」，而是当前时刻、当前渠道、当前温区下<strong>有权被分配</strong>的批次集合。它由三个维度的笛卡尔积经资格过滤得来：批次维度（lot/batch）、库位维度（bin/location）、状态维度（stock status）。</p>\n<p>一个可执行的候选池定义，用集合语言写出来是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∣</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>sku</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>b</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>ATP</mtext><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mtext>reserved</mtext><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext> pass</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>o</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_o = \\{\\, (l,b,q) \\mid l \\in L_{\\text{sku}},\\ b \\in B_l,\\ q = \\text{ATP}_{l,b}(t) - \\text{reserved}^{soft}_{l,b} &gt; 0 \\ \\wedge\\ \\text{pass}(l,b,o) \\,\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sku</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ATP</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4044em;vertical-align:-0.4374em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">reserved</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.967em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">so</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4374em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pass</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <code>pass(l,b,o)</code> 是六项硬性资格判断的合取：质检已放行、未落入活动召回、温区与订单目的地匹配、库位可达（未冻结、非盘点中）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>RSL</mtext><mi>l</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><msub><mtext>MRSL</mtext><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RSL}_l(t) \\ge \\text{MRSL}_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RSL</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MRSL</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、货权未质押或海关扣留。任一为否即剔除——注意这是在<strong>构建候选池</strong>阶段做，而不是等拣货才发现拣不出来。</p>\n<p>候选池就绪后进入评分。纯 FEFO 用的是字典序元组，但真实引擎几乎都会加一层带权评分以处理「近效期批次可走折扣渠道」「整托优先降低作业成本」这类软目标：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mtext>RSL</mtext><mi>l</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><msub><mtext>RSL</mtext><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mtext>dist</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>o</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>需拆托</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext>cost</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score}(l,b) = w_e \\cdot \\frac{\\text{RSL}_{l}(t)}{\\text{RSL}_{\\max}} + w_d \\cdot \\frac{1}{1 + \\text{dist}(b,o)} - w_f \\cdot \\mathbb{1}[\\text{需拆托}(b)] - w_{\\text{cost}} \\cdot \\frac{c_l - c_{\\min}}{c_{\\max} - c_{\\min}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.263em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RSL</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RSL</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2574em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dist</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7306em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">需拆托</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cost</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>RSL 项保证主方向仍是先到期先出，距离项把「离拣货口近的库位」提前以减少行走，拆托与成本项是惩罚。需要警惕的是：一旦引入随机权重或外部模型评分，分配结果就不再能靠一行排序键复现，而召回审计常会追问「为什么这一单发 B 批不发 A 批」。因此<strong>评分函数的输入必须与占用记录一起落档</strong>——候选集合快照、各批 RSL、各权重取值、最终选择，构成一条可回放的决策证据链。这也是 GS1 的可追溯事件模型（EPCIS，<code>gs1.org/standards/epcis</code>）要求把「分配/拣货/发运」作为独立事件记录的原因：事件而非快照，才是审计能核对的形态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"硬预留的并发争抢与原子扣减\">硬预留的并发争抢与原子扣减</h2><p>多个订单同时争抢同一候选池时，问题从「选哪批」变成「怎么保证不超卖」。诱惑是读-判-写（read-check-write）三步骤：先读可用量、判断够不够、再写回扣减，这个模式在并发下必然超卖，因为读与写之间存在窗口。正确做法是把扣减做成<strong>单条原子比较并交换（CAS）</strong>，在数据库里落成条件更新：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"UPDATE lot_stock&#10;SET available_qty = available_qty - :qty,&#10;    reserved_qty  = reserved_qty  + :qty&#10;WHERE lot_id = :lot AND location_id = :loc&#10;  AND status = &#39;RELEASED&#39; AND recalled = false&#10;  AND available_qty &gt;= :qty;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lot_stock</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> available_qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> available_qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :qty,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    reserved_qty  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reserved_qty  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :qty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lot_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :lot </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> location_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :loc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'RELEASED'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recalled </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> available_qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :qty;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>WHERE available_qty &gt;= :qty</code> 让「够不够」和「扣多少」在同一条语句里成立，受影响行数为 0 即代表抢占失败，引擎据此重新构建候选池或换个批次重试（<code>retry with backoff</code>）。</p>\n<p>乐观并发的代价是重试风暴：热门 SKU 在零点可能几十条请求循环争抢同一行。三种缓解手段常组合使用：<strong>分段计数（sharded counter）<strong>把某批次某库位的可用量拆成 N 个分片各自 CAS，降低单行热点，代价是聚合读要跨分片求和且可能出现「总量够但某分片不足」的碎片化；<strong>批内串行化</strong>对同一 (lot, location) 的请求按哈希路由到同一处理器串行处理，把并发冲突转为排队；<strong>柔性约束</strong>允许少量超卖作为业务容忍度，配合事后改发同效期替代批次或补偿券，被国内大促广泛采用，但</strong>医药与冷链领域通常不允许</strong>——批次可替换性受监管限制，必须严格不超卖。</p>\n<p>跨库位、跨仓的分配还牵涉事务边界。一条聚合根原则适用：<strong>一次事务只改一个聚合</strong>。批次库存单元是天然聚合根，订单行占用记录是另一个聚合。二者用「占用记录先落、库存 CAS 后落，失败则补偿回滚」的最终一致方式衔接，而非开一个横跨订单与库存的大事务——大事务在跨境多仓下会持有大量行锁，吞吐会崩。补偿动作必须有幂等键（<code>reservation_id + operation_seq</code>），否则重试会把同一个释放执行两次，造成可用量虚增。</p>\n<h2 id=\"预留的生命周期-ttl-与释放回收\">预留的生命周期、TTL 与释放回收</h2><p>一条预留记录从生到死要走完固定状态机，任何一环缺失都会导致库存「泄漏」——占用永不归还，<code>available_qty</code> 持续虚减，表现为「后台看有货、前端却拣不出」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  S[SOFT 下单软预留] --&gt;|分仓/波次下派| H[HARD 硬预留]&#10;  S --&gt;|支付超时/订单取消| R[RELEASED 已释放]&#10;  H --&gt;|拣货完成 + 出库核减| C[CONSUMED 已消耗]&#10;  H --&gt;|拣货失败/缺货改派| R&#10;  H --&gt;|TTL 到期未推进| X[EXPIRED 已过期]&#10;  X --&gt;|回收任务归还| R&#10;  R --&gt; Z[终态]&#10;  C --&gt; Z\">flowchart TD\n  S[SOFT 下单软预留] --&gt;|分仓/波次下派| H[HARD 硬预留]\n  S --&gt;|支付超时/订单取消| R[RELEASED 已释放]\n  H --&gt;|拣货完成 + 出库核减| C[CONSUMED 已消耗]\n  H --&gt;|拣货失败/缺货改派| R\n  H --&gt;|TTL 到期未推进| X[EXPIRED 已过期]\n  X --&gt;|回收任务归还| R\n  R --&gt; Z[终态]\n  C --&gt; Z</pre><p>状态迁移的每个非终态都必须带 <strong>TTL（time-to-live）</strong>，这是防止泄漏的最后防线。TTL 应是「业务 SLA + 安全余量」的函数而非全局常数：即时零售可能 15 分钟，跨境保税备货可能 48 小时。到期后由<strong>独立于请求链路的回收任务</strong>扫描并归还，绝不能只依赖客户端主动释放——客户端崩溃、网络断开、消息丢失都会让主动释放落空。释放的实现必须<strong>幂等且不重复回补</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>release</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>回补 </mtext><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mtext> 至 </mtext><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>l</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>if state</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext>SOFT</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>HARD</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>EXPIRED</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>no-op</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>otherwise</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{release}(r) = \\begin{cases} \\text{回补 } q_r \\text{ 至 } available_{l,b}, &amp; \\text{if } \\text{state}(r) \\in \\{\\text{SOFT}, \\text{HARD}, \\text{EXPIRED}\\} \\\\ \\text{no-op}, &amp; \\text{otherwise} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">release</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">回补</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">至</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ab</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">no-op</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if </span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">state</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SOFT</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HARD</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EXPIRED</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">otherwise</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>状态条件是关键：已 <code>CONSUMED</code> 的预留不能再回补，否则会把已出库的货凭空加回可用量。回收任务应按状态与 <code>ttl_at</code> 建索引分片扫描，避免一次性 <code>SELECT ... WHERE ttl_at &lt; now()</code> 拉全量。与释放对称的是<strong>占用沉降</strong>：软预留转硬预留时若原批次已被抢占需「换批」——释放原软预留、对新批次建硬预留，并记录 <code>reallocation</code> 事件与原因码。这在跨渠道合单、盘点后尤其频繁，是发错批次差异的主要来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"锁定粒度-渠道隔离与释放策略\">锁定粒度、渠道隔离与释放策略</h2><p>预留锁什么粒度，直接决定系统的精度与吞吐上限。粒度越粗，实现越简单但越容易「锁而不准」；越细，越精确定位但并发压力越大。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>锁定粒度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SKU × 仓（聚合层）</td>\n<td>渠道铺货、预售资格校验</td>\n<td>并发低、吞吐高</td>\n<td>不能保证拣到指定批次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SKU × 批次（lot 层）</td>\n<td>效期敏感、召回可追</td>\n<td>精准到批次、支持 FEFO</td>\n<td>锁行多、热点集中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SKU × 批次 × 库位（bin 层）</td>\n<td>波次拣货、多巷道仓库</td>\n<td>精确定位到物理位</td>\n<td>冲突最密、实现最复杂</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实战里通常<strong>分层降级</strong>：商品页与购物车只扣 SKU 层 ATP 作为「防超卖」的粗闸；支付成功后下派仓库时，才把 SKU 层占用沉降为 lot×bin 的细占用。这样把昂贵细锁的持有时间压缩到「支付完成 → 拣货指派」这个必然发生的短窗口，而非「加购 → 支付」这个可能长达数天的窗口。<strong>渠道隔离</strong>是另一条必须显式设计的边界。若自营商城、第三方平台、批发 B 端共享同一个可用量池，一个渠道的突发流量会瞬间吃掉另一渠道的货。常见做法是给每个渠道维护<strong>配额（allocation quota）</strong>：把某批次的可用量预先划分给各渠道，渠道内先在本渠道配额内分配，配额不足才走「跨渠道借调」，并记录借调事件：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>Channels</mtext></mrow></munder><msub><mtext>quota</mtext><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>buffer</mtext><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>ATP</mtext><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{c \\in \\text{Channels}} \\text{quota}_{l,b,c} + \\text{buffer}_{l,b} = \\text{ATP}_{l,b}(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3795em;vertical-align:-1.3295em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Channels</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3295em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">quota</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">buffer</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ATP</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>配额与借用必须可审计——跨境场景下不同渠道的合规要求（如保税仓与直邮的效期门槛、销毁规则）本身就不同，通道错配会直接触发合规问题。</p>\n<p><strong>释放策略</strong>决定了系统在高竞争下的偏向。激进释放（TTL 短、缺货即释放）周转快但可能下单后被告知缺货；保守释放（TTL 长、坚持保留）履约确定性高但易造成近效期积压——尤其对临期商品，晚一天释放就少一天去化窗口。因此释放策略应与效期联动：对 RSL 已进入近效期阈值的批次，TTL 应显著缩短，让近效期库存尽快回到可售池走折扣渠道。释放事件本身也是经营信号，应汇总成「因占用过期而浪费的可售时间」指标，用于调优 TTL 与配额。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>分配引擎的三个不可省输入：候选池、占用语义（软/硬锁）、生命周期。缺任一项就退化为粗糙的「有货即可下单」。</li>\n<li>占用 ≠ 拣货。占用是履约前的产能承诺，拣货是仓库动作，二者之间必须有一条可完整回滚的 <code>reservation_id</code> 链路，绝不能把占用直接当成扣减库存。</li>\n<li>候选池是资格过滤的结果而非「所有库存」；质量放行、召回、温区、RSL ≥ MRSL 应在进入排序前剔除。</li>\n<li>评分加入随机权重后，必须把评分输入（候选快照、RSL、权重）随占用落档，否则召回审计无法复现「为何发这批」。</li>\n<li>扣减务必用单条原子 CAS（<code>WHERE available_qty &gt;= :qty</code>），绝不 read-check-write；热点用分片计数、串行化或柔性约束缓解，但医药冷链不允许超卖。</li>\n<li>每个非终态预留都要有 TTL，释放由独立回收任务执行、必须幂等且带状态条件——已消耗的预留不可回补。</li>\n<li>锁定粒度分层降级（SKU 层防超卖 → lot×bin 层精确定位），渠道用配额隔离并记录借调，释放策略与效期联动。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"拣货分配引擎与批次预留/锁定/释放机制","id":"拣货分配引擎与批次预留-锁定-释放机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"候选池构建与批次评分","id":"候选池构建与批次评分"},{"level":2,"text":"硬预留的并发争抢与原子扣减","id":"硬预留的并发争抢与原子扣减"},{"level":2,"text":"预留的生命周期、TTL 与释放回收","id":"预留的生命周期-ttl-与释放回收"},{"level":2,"text":"锁定粒度、渠道隔离与释放策略","id":"锁定粒度-渠道隔离与释放策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"FEFO 分配原理与效期优先排序（FEFO/FIFO/LIFO 对照）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/lot-batch-expiry-fefo-traceability-management/fefo-picking-expiry-allocation/fefo-ordering-expiry-priority-principle"},"next":{"title":"近效期/过期批次异常、替代拣货与缺货短拣处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/lot-batch-expiry-fefo-traceability-management/fefo-picking-expiry-allocation/near-expiry-substitution-shortfall"}}